==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Zroco]]s spawn, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Baa Baa]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*1 [[Le'boin]] spawns after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Zigge]]s spawn after 180 seconds<sup>5,400f</sup>, delay 20~40 seconds<sup>600f~1,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
You can simply rush this stage with [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Giraffe Cat]] as there are minimal peons at the start, but if you are too slow, Le'boin and Zigge may spawn.

